OL,3,GNEWSADriver who tried to dodge speeding
OL,4,Apoints jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who tried to claim a driver from
OL,7,FNigeria was using his car after it was
OL,8,Fcaught by a speed camera on the M1 has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FSyed Miah's car was seen being driven
OL,12,Fat 79mph (127km/h) near Wakefield on 6
OL,13,FJune 2024, but he told police he was
OL,14,Fnot the driver.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
