OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADriver who tried to dodge speeding
OL,4,Apoints jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiah, 48, of St Luke's Road, Beeston,
OL,7,Fclaimed a friend had been driving his
OL,8,FMercedes and sent false documents to
OL,9,Fpolice, including a printout of a
OL,10,FNigerian driving licence, a Nigerian
OL,11,Finternational driving permit and an
OL,12,Finternational phone number, but the man
OL,13,Fcould not be traced.
OL,15,FMiah was jailed on Monday at Leeds
OL,16,FCrown Court for one year and four
OL,17,Fmonths after pleading guilty to
OL,18,Fperverting the course of justice at a
OL,19,Fhearing on 16 October.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
